      "locked": false,
      "text": "FRONTEND CLIENT ARCHITECTURE\n(React + Vite + Tailwind CSS)\n\n• App.jsx: Main Router with Protected Routes\n• AuthContext.jsx: Manages JWT token & user session\n• Axios.js API Layer: Attaches authorization headers\n\nViews & Pages:\n- LandingPage: Landing page, exploring hackathons\n- AuthPage: Login/Signup cards with 3D Flip transitions\n- TeamDashboard: Submission, team creation, join requests, code copy\n- AdminPanel: User bans, role promotions/demotions, event list, judge\nassignments\n- JudgingPortal: Progress metrics, project cards, slider evaluation form\n- Leaderboard: Standings podiums (1st/2nd/3rd), overall tables",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": "el_2",
      "originalText": "FRONTEND CLIENT ARCHITECTURE\n(React + Vite + Tailwind CSS)\n\n• App.jsx: Main Router with Protected Routes\n• AuthContext.jsx: Manages JWT token & user session\n• Axios.js API Layer: Attaches authorization headers\n\nViews & Pages:\n- LandingPage: Landing page, exploring hackathons\n- AuthPage: Login/Signup cards with 3D Flip transitions\n- TeamDashboard: Submission, team creation, join requests, code copy\n- AdminPanel: User bans, role promotions/demotions, event list, judge assignments\n- JudgingPortal: Progress metrics, project cards, slider evaluation form\n- Leaderboard: Standings podiums (1st/2nd/3rd), overall tables",
