      "locked": false,
      "text": "BACKEND SERVER WORKFLOW\n(Node.js + Express.js)\n\n• Server.js: Initializes connection & server listener\n• App.js: Sets security headers (Helmet), CORS, cookieParser, global limits\n• AuthMiddleware: protects & checks user roles (isAdmin)\n\nControllers & APIs:\n- authController: Login/register with JWT and OTP checks\n- userController: Profile edits & mobile OTP verification\n- eventController: Events setup & assigned events query\n- teamController: Creation, joining, captain submission\n- evaluationController: Submissions listing, dynamic scoring evaluation, leaderboard aggregates, publish release action",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": "el_4",
      "originalText": "BACKEND SERVER WORKFLOW\n(Node.js + Express.js)\n\n• Server.js: Initializes connection & server listener\n• App.js: Sets security headers (Helmet), CORS, cookieParser, global limits\n• AuthMiddleware: protects & checks user roles (isAdmin)\n\nControllers & APIs:\n- authController: Login/register with JWT and OTP checks\n- userController: Profile edits & mobile OTP verification\n- eventController: Events setup & assigned events query\n- teamController: Creation, joining, captain submission\n- evaluationController: Submissions listing, dynamic scoring evaluation, leaderboard aggregates, publish release action",
