      "text": "DATABASE LAYER (Mongoose + MongoDB Atlas)\n\n• user.model: Schema for profiles, credentials, OTP, reset\ntokens\n• event.model: Timelines, tracks, prizes, dynamic judging\ncriteria list\n• team.model: Members, codes, project references (github,\nvideo)\n• registration.model: Compound unique user-event tickets\n• evaluation.model: Links team/event/judge, stores dynamic\nscores array, calculates weighted totals pre-save",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": "el_6",
      "originalText": "DATABASE LAYER (Mongoose + MongoDB Atlas)\n\n• user.model: Schema for profiles, credentials, OTP, reset tokens\n• event.model: Timelines, tracks, prizes, dynamic judging criteria list\n• team.model: Members, codes, project references (github, video)\n• registration.model: Compound unique user-event tickets\n• evaluation.model: Links team/event/judge, stores dynamic scores array, calculates weighted totals pre-save",
