      "text": "EXTERNAL UTILITIES & SERVICES\n\n• SMTP email client (Nodemailer):\n  - sendEmail: Dispatch email OTPs\n  - sendTicketEmail: Dispatch tickets with QR inline\n  - sendLeaderboardEmail: Dispatch leaderboard releases\n\n• Cloudinary SDK:\n  - Profile pictures, event promotional banners\n\n• QR code generator:\n  - Generate ticket data URIs",
